# Topic 4 — Formatting

## Objective

Practice Excel formatting techniques using a Pinterest Analytics dataset.

## Skills Practiced

- Changed font style and size
- Applied bold and font colors
- Applied cell background colors
- Adjusted column widths
- Adjusted row heights
- Applied borders
- Practiced horizontal alignment
- Practiced vertical alignment
- Used Wrap Text
- Used Merge & Center for a worksheet title
- Used Format Painter
- Practiced Undo and Redo

## Project

The practice workbook contains Pinterest Pin performance data including:

- Date
- Pin Title
- Category
- Impressions
- Engagements
- Saves
- Outbound Clicks

## Formatting Principles

The worksheet was formatted to improve:

- Readability
- Organization
- Data visibility
- Professional presentation

## Key Learning

Excel formatting should make data easier to understand without unnecessarily changing the underlying data.

## File

`Pinterest_Formatting_Practice.xlsx`